      <title>France Protests: Fiscal Mess Can Only Be Solved With Discipline</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-20/france-protests-fiscal-mess-can-only-be-solved-with-discipline</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">9ed2f8b004dcd5e0758fcc19</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 04:00:35 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>France’s crisis keeps getting more extreme, spilling over the weekend into broader protests that precipitated hundreds of millions of euros in damage and nearly 2,400 arrests. The country’s leaders are rightly focused on curtailing the violence. Yet as they seek ways to placate a frustrated populace, they must be careful not to make a bad fiscal situation worse.</description>
